.DS_Store
*.DS_Store

# The build context the publish workflow assembles. `payload/` is the unpacked
# release asset and `payload-download/` is the tarball it came from. NEITHER
# MAY EVER BE COMMITTED: the workflow creates both directories inside this
# working tree on every run, so a local `docker build` followed by a
# `git add -A` would commit a build artefact into the repository's history.
/payload/
/payload-download/
